+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+The school rents boards and sails to students and visitors, and the booking desk has no software for it yet. A first, basic rental module lets the desk price and book equipment without double-booking it.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add an in-memory rental service, created with `createRentalService()` and exported from `src/index.ts`.
+- The service registers equipment (`addEquipment`), prices a rental period (`quote`) and books it (`book`).
+- Prices are integer euro cents, times are UTC ISO-8601, bookings cover whole days and never overlap for the same item.
+- The cancellation policy (no refund under 24 hours before start, otherwise full refund) is a school rule that the module must stay compatible with. Cancelling itself is **not** implemented in this change.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `equipment-rental`: registering rentable equipment, quoting and booking whole-day rental periods, with the school's money, time, and no-overlap rules.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+- New code under `src/` (the repository has none yet) and its tests; no dependencies added.
+- New public API: `createRentalService()` and its types.
